{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1151894-cookbooks","id":1151894,"title":"Cookbooks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-22T03:43:46-07:00","id":1151894,"title":"Cookbooks","content":"Something i have noticed being releases for the 20th anniversary lines (at least WtA and MtAs) are the '[game line] Cookbook'. and its great, I love it.<br /> Now I know its a long shot but is there any chance of the CofD lines getting Cookbooks? or were these KS rewards?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T05:22:55-07:00","id":1151910,"title":"","content":"I too quite liked the WtA cookbook, But Don't really See that happening for ChroD. Would love an Uratha-, Changeling or Beast cooling book.<br /> Random capitalization ftw due to phone","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T05:51:04-07:00","id":1151915,"title":"","content":"tbh i think the main barrier to CofD getting cookbooks is that the various groups (y splats and the like) are a lot less tied to culture than cWoD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T07:32:45-07:00","id":1151930,"title":"","content":"Can someone describe what X20th Cookbook are all about? To better show what could they add to CoD gamelines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T07:50:38-07:00","id":1151934,"title":"","content":"the W20 cookbook (the only one released although M20 is in Proofing) is part cookbook full of recipes. part in character document in the form of a book 'A Culinary Guide to the Garou Nation' written from the point of view of a silent strider who was training to be a chef before his first change, it details a recipe for each of the tribes, including the Changing breeds and the lost tribes, with each recipe there is a passage in the food of that tribe and the authors tracking down and adaptation of the recipe, it also includes notes on making the recipes veggie, vegan and/or gluten free where possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:",